' =====================================
' Legend
' =====================================
legend right
    |= Phase |= Color |= Focus |
    | Current State | <color:#FFCDD2>Red</color> | Pain & limitations |
    | Transition | <color:#FFF9C4>Yellow</color> | Decision & catalyst |
    | Financial | <color:#C8E6C9>Green</color> | Revenue & profit |
